(33, 'rm-pico-101', 'guest_pico_01', 'Jessica Cruz', 5, 'The lagoon view from the balcony was so peaceful! Access to the Pico de Loro beach club and water sports made it the ultimate Batangas weekend getaway.', '2026-10-10 16:33:58'),
(34, 'rm-pico-202', 'guest_pico_02', 'Ramon Bautista', 5, 'Smooth scenic drive from Manila through the Kaybiang Tunnel. Pristine cove, clear waters, and very spacious rooms. Highly recommended!', '2026-10-10 16:33:59'),
(35, 'rm-canyon-101', 'guest_canyon_01', 'Mark Villanueva', 5, 'Massive swimming pool right next to the white sand beach! The sunset views in Nasugbu from the balcony were stunning. Great family weekend destination.', '2026-10-10 16:41:00'),
(36, 'rm-canyon-202', 'guest_canyon_02', 'Angela Soriano', 5, 'Loved the beachfront room. We could walk right out to the shore in seconds. Water sports like banana boat and jetski were easily arranged.', '2026-10-10 16:41:00');
